# Discord Messaging Style

When writing any message, announcement, or post that will be sent to the Parlance Discord server:

- Do NOT use em dashes (—) or en dashes (–) anywhere in the text
- Use commas, periods, or line breaks instead
- Keep tone warm and direct

**Bad:** "We built this for aspiring interpreters — people serious about language."
**Good:** "We built this for aspiring interpreters, people serious about language."
